WEBVTT

NOTE
This file was generated by Descript <www.descript.com>

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:04.800
Leah: Therapy can often vary in scope,
they may be provided one-to-one, in

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.840
a group, online, over the phone, or
with family in a health care centre

00:00:08.849 --> 00:00:13.959
setting, but what therapies all
have in common is that they take

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.590
place with a trained therapist.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:20.250
Rhiannon: If the waiting lists for
‘Talking therapies’ available on the NHS

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:25.450
are too long in an area, there are also
private agencies or independent services.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:29.640
These have to be paid for and
this type of service is run like

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:33.990
a business, but can be much more
accessible and much more immediate.

00:00:35.199 --> 00:00:38.010
Leah: Some parents of children
and young people, may wish to seek

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:42.070
independent care because they feel a
more specialist targeted treatment is

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.609
needed, over a longer period of time.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.589
Sometimes they may feel treatment
in a private clinic or hospital

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.010
is more appropriate for them.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:54.809
Rhiannon: All health professionals are
available privately as well as through

00:00:55.090 --> 00:01:00.270
NHS channels, including GPs, Therapists
and Counsellors, and Psychiatrists.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:08.300
The costs of treatment and support
can vary depending upon the type and

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:12.959
duration of the treatment, but private
treatment can work very favourably

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:17.150
for those who want help immediately
and have the ability to pay for it.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:21.800
Leah: GPs should be able to
signpost an individual to specific

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:25.370
professionals, whether this is
through the NHS or privately.

00:01:25.969 --> 00:01:30.360
Therapists and counsellors can be
approached directly or by referral and

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:34.860
there are many organisations online that
can recommend or showcase these services.

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:39.989
Rhiannon: Therapy is a good alternative
or complementary approach to mental health

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.899
care and if the individual is willing to
do the work, therapy can be rewarding.

00:01:47.619 --> 00:01:53.080
Therapies like CBT also include
Self-help books and computer courses

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:57.090
and guided self-help is recommended
as a treatment for depression,

00:01:57.139 --> 00:01:59.139
anxiety and panic disorder.

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:04.749
Guided self-help aims to give helpful
tools and techniques that can carry on

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:07.070
being used after the course has finished.

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:11.650
Leah: Therapy is a safe, judgment-free
space, where an individual can share

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:15.479
anything with a trained professional,
who is there to improve mental health

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:19.239
and increase mind and body wellness,
without relying on medication.

